  ],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "We do not want to rebuild the same overlapped sums again and again.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 4500,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 135,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Suppose the current prefix sum is S.",
      "start_ms": 5120,
      "end_ms": 7840,
      "start_frame": 154,
      "end_frame": 235,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "For a subarray sum to be exactly k, we need an earlier prefix equal to S minus k.",
      "start_ms": 8340,
      "end_ms": 15620,
      "start_frame": 250,
      "end_frame": 469,
      "word_count": 18
    },
    {
      "text": "So at every position, we only need to look for current prefix minus k.",
      "start_ms": 16300,
      "end_ms": 21800,
      "start_frame": 489,
      "end_frame": 654,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "But the same prefix value can appear more than once.",
      "start_ms": 22060,
      "end_ms": 25380,
      "start_frame": 662,
      "end_frame": 761,
      "word_count": 10
    },
    {
      "text": "So we need frequency, not just existence.",
      "start_ms": 25840,
      "end_ms": 29040,
      "start_frame": 775,
      "end_frame": 871,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Our hash map stores prefix sum to frequency.",
      "start_ms": 29660,
      "end_ms": 33740,
      "start_frame": 890,
      "end_frame": 1012,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "And initially, zero maps to one.",
      "start_ms": 34400,
      "end_ms": 36840,
      "start_frame": 1032,
      "end_frame": 1105,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Because before reading the array, there is already one prefix position with sum zero.",
      "start_ms": 37300,
      "end_ms": 43280,
      "start_frame": 1119,
      "end_frame": 1298,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "One more important rule.",
      "start_ms": 44060,
      "end_ms": 45380,
      "start_frame": 1322,
      "end_frame": 1361,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The map should contain only earlier prefix positions.",
      "start_ms": 45780,
      "end_ms": 48920,
      "start_frame": 1373,
      "end_frame": 1468,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "So first, update the current prefix.",
      "start_ms": 49700,
      "end_ms": 52120,
      "start_frame": 1491,
      "end_frame": 1564,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Then compute.",
      "start_ms": 52580,
      "end_ms": 53320,
      "start_frame": 1577,
      "end_frame": 1600,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Needed equals prefix minus k.",
      "start_ms": 53920,
      "end_ms": 56660,
      "start_frame": 1618,
      "end_frame": 1700,
      "word_count": 5
    },
    {
      "text": "Look up the frequency of needed.",
      "start_ms": 57280,
      "end_ms": 58960,
      "start_frame": 1718,
      "end_frame": 1769,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Add that frequency to the answer.",
      "start_ms": 59840,
      "end_ms": 62060,
      "start_frame": 1795,
      "end_frame": 1862,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "And only after that, store the current prefix.",
      "start_ms": 62900,
      "end_ms": 66100,
      "start_frame": 1887,
      "end_frame": 1983,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "So the order is update prefix.",
      "start_ms": 66980,
      "end_ms": 69300,
      "start_frame": 2009,
      "end_frame": 2079,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Look back, count.",
      "start_ms": 70240,
      "end_ms": 71680,
      "start_frame": 2107,
      "end_frame": 2150,
      "word_count": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "Then store.",
      "start_ms": 72560,
      "end_ms": 73140,
      "start_frame": 2177,
      "end_frame": 2194,
      "word_count": 2
    },
    {
      "text": "Now let us execute it on the full array.",
      "start_ms": 74280,
      "end_ms": 76840,
      "start_frame": 2228,
      "end_frame": 2305,
      "word_count": 9
    }
  ],
